 edge heading into the final weeks.\n\nRaters are split: Cook Political Report, Inside Elections and Fox News call the race a Tossup, while several others rate it a Democratic flip, from Lean to Likely. Kalshi markets price the Democrat near 90 percent. Coverage has centered on immigration enforcement and healthcare in a heavily Latino district, alongside debates over the economy and water. With no public polling available, the forecast rests on fundamentals and expert consensus, pointing to a narrow Democratic edge in a genuinely competitive race.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7982, "margin": 5.28}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.8298, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.8404, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.8532, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.8134, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.7945, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.8475, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.8189, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.8075, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.8433, "margin": 6.2}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.8577, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.8627, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.8486, "margin": 6.3}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.8166, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.8055, "margin": 6.2}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.8014, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.8417, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.7331, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.7747, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.823, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.8359, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.8383, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.8323, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.7982, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.8145, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem":